At puberty, under the effect of oestrogen, a girl develops:

1. **enlargement of the breasts** (development of mammary glands);
2. **widening of the hips** (broad pelvis);
3. growth of **pubic hair** and **hair under the armpits**;
4. deposition of **fat** under the skin, giving a rounded body shape;
5. a **high-pitched voice**.

(Any four.)
